[ItemExists]
public async Task<IActionResult> GetById(Guid id)
{
...
}
[HttpPut("{id:guid}")]
[ItemExists]
public async Task<IActionResult> Put(Guid id, EditItemCommand
request)
{
...
}
}
}
After applying the ItemExists attribute, the API will return 404 if the ID sent by the
request doesn't exist. We can also verify the logic implemented in the action filter by
